    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'It''s a machine from long ago. Don''t think anyone ''ere has ever seen
        one of these. It''s a <style=MAC>Mechanical Autonomous Crafter</style>, or
        <style=MAC>MAC</style>, for short. '
